                <pb facs="0128" n="56" sameAs="frus:frus1882/pg56"/>

                <head>No. 35.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Frelinghuysen to Mr.
                    Trescot</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1882-01-03"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 3,
                        1882</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Exert pacific influence. Avoid any issue leading to your withdrawal from
                    Chili.</p>
                <closer><signed>FRELINGHUYSEN.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
